{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkcfDrYqbvKRHiCDrwRN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've gone through 8 of the 13 screens and I'm stopping there. I'd have closed the page on the bus by then.\n\n**What I'd tell a friend:** You can take the money out tax-free 6 years after the first deposit, or after 3 years if you've hit retirement age or it's for studies. On the page's example (300 ₪ a month from you, 900 from the employer, an S&P track), pulling out after 5 years leaves you roughly 66,500 ₪. That's still before the 6 years, so tax takes a bite of about 14,000. I'm fairly sure about the 6 years. The amount is only a rough guess, because the scroll-up button covers the big result number (\"66,5…\") and I never saw what year 6 or later gives.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n1. The top: the heading \"קרן השתלמות\", then \"אחרי 6 שנים... אפשר למשוך... בלי מס\". That line was my answer for \"when\".\n2. Screen 2: the bit about \"15,712 ₪\" and \"20,566 ₪\". I didn't get it. Some kind of cap?\n3. The calculator: \"מושכים את הכסף אחרי 5 שנים\", the yearly bars with \"לפני 6 שנים: מס\" on one side and \"מ־6 שנים: פטור ממס\" on the other. Under them, bars for \"+54,000\", \"+8,487\", \"−13,974\" and \"66,5…\".\n4. The text under the bars: \"50,719 ₪ נכנסים קודם\", \"29,768 ₪ למס הכנסה\", \"15,794 ₪ מהם חוזרים\". That confused me. Do I get 50k or 66k? I gave up on it.\n5. After that I skimmed the headings \"שווה לדעת\", \"מי מציע ומי מצטרף\", \"משיכה ומעבר\", and \"כמה זה עולה\" with its \"לא גובים\" lines.\n\n**What I skipped:** The grey text about assumptions and inflation, all the \"חוקים וכללים\" pills, the KH-19 / PF-18 tags, the dropdown listing the companies, and screens 9–13.\n\n**Where I got stuck:**\n- The page starts the example at 5 years, which is exactly the year you still pay tax. Why not show me 6? I can't move the slider here.\n- The ₪ numbers fight each other: 50,719 vs 66,5… vs −13,974.\n- I'm not sure \"+54,000\" sits over \"המעסיק הוסיף\". Over 5 years that would be 900 ₪ a month, but I'm not checking.\n- The calculator's start is cut off between screens 2 and 3, so I never saw a salary field.\n- The bar colours: I guessed yellow is deposits, teal is returns, and the pink stripes are tax.\n\n**What I'd change:**\n- Move the up-arrow button so it doesn't cover the main number.\n- Start the example at 6 years.\n- Give one clear sentence: \"after 6 years you'd have X ₪\"."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1872,"cache_read_input_tokens":17661,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1872},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"efee7d46-be47-44f7-a749-08a328b06003","uuid":"ab9dcc9f-3688-4a66-9c2d-58dd9377b204","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:03:13.363Z","request_id":"req_011CgkcfDeeSNXTbDsETqqWF"}
